  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fcf7219bab7fe46a1ad266029b2fee19, type: 3}
  m_Name: Readme
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 9266273b8f123004195741f969177dda, type: 3}
  title: Prefab folder
  sections:
  - heading: What should I put here ?
    text: In this folder, every prefab or prefab variant that is destined to be put
      directly in the game can be stored. Mesh prefabs, or intermediate prefabs that
      may only exist within other prefabs should not be stored here, but rather in
      the most suitable place according to you (preferably near other assets that
      use them).
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: What shouldn't I put here ?
    text: Anything that isn't a prefab or prefab variant shouldn't be here. For graphics
      prefabs, only put them here if they are meant to be directly put in a scene.
      Do not put here a Leaf prefab, for example, if Leaf prefabs should only exist
      inside Tree prefabs
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: Gameplay prefab
    text: If your prefab has no functionnality except being seen (graphics), put
      it in the Graphics folder. If it is associated with a gameplay element with
      graphics, put it in gameplay. If it serves another purpose (helper, data, etc.),
      put it in other.
    linkText: 
    url: 
  loadedLayout: 1
